    "contract": "GORM v1.31.2 DB.Begin starts a transaction and DB.Commit calls the underlying Tx.Commit and stores its error (finisher_api.go). A nil DB.Error after Commit is GORM's report that the transaction committed. gorm.io/driver/postgres v1.6.3 uses pgx stdlib. This adapter passes *sql.DB through Config.Conn. SavePoint and RollbackTo are the explicit savepoint API. The postgres dialector executes the SQL and returns nil from SavePoint and RollbackTo.",
